// Whether the export at index ek is a conf.id constant. A constant has a value
// before any setup has run, so unlike an export it needs no `given`, and the
// positions it may stand in (a setup's or a check's argument, a check's index)
// are decided from the state fit_import's callers raise, not from its owner.

imp_conf(int ek) {
  int is_conf = 0;
  if(ek >= 0) {
    if((import eowners)[ek] == "conf.id") {
      is_conf = 1;
    }
  }
} return int is_conf;
given impcase_empty given string_list_set((import eowners), 0, "conf.id") (0):(1)
(-1):(0)
given impcase_empty given string_list_set((import eowners), 0, "fx_target") (0):(0)
